After a long string of dead archeologists I finally had a fairly
promising game going. Then I stepped on a polytrap in the Mines and
turned into a shrieker. Not much useful that a shrieker could do, so I
just sat there waiting for some monster to come along and kill me so I
could revert to human form and return to my game.

So the first monster that happened along was a chickatrice. He
attacked me, my limbs (what limbs? I'm a shrieker!) stiffened, I
turned to stone... DYWYPI?

Hmm, while this was not completely unexpected I do wonder under what
other circumstances one might not be immune from death while
polymorphed. (I know about the amulet of unchanging.) Or do you only
revert to natural form if you're reduced to 0HP? This is in vanilla
I'm asking about...

